    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/69f2ac23564dec34b4a934a8a00e1709.avif?t=1740316050\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/85edf1d8557ef1f264bd329421fc3e1b.avif?t=1740316050\" width=316 height=112 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/f9cf8a8ab7e8aefd7d6d7a926980f8dd.avif?t=1740316050\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunted mansion. A date gone bad. A kidnapped friend! Can YOU help Andy save the day?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/394b0f6559909add9939e19639a4d6bb.avif?t=1740316050\" width=64 height=64 /></span> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/d0ab706e6fb0bcc8ffceff0b4de61341.avif?t=1740316050\" width=260 height=132 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/9718bdedfbc81b7da53079710a4e7634.poster.avif?t=1740316050\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/9718bdedfbc81b7da53079710a4e7634.webm?t=1740316050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/9718bdedfbc81b7da53079710a4e7634.mp4?t=1740316050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A spiritual successor to &quot;Dangerous Dave and the Haunted Mansion&quot;; Andy Blast Vs The Forces of Evil is a retro platformer with a shotgun! Jump, dodge, shoot, and survive through nine levels of intense pixel-pumping action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/5d88fe594c46869d217e5e42cabacd4a.poster.avif?t=1740316050\" width=448 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/5d88fe594c46869d217e5e42cabacd4a.webm?t=1740316050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/ca5a8694f077dee9b3dd349e25c9d984.poster.avif?t=1740316050\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/ca5a8694f077dee9b3dd349e25c9d984.webm?t=1740316050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/ca5a8694f077dee9b3dd349e25c9d984.mp4?t=1740316050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/69f2ac23564dec34b4a934a8a00e1709.avif?t=1740316050\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/85edf1d8557ef1f264bd329421fc3e1b.avif?t=1740316050\" width=316 height=112 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/f9cf8a8ab7e8aefd7d6d7a926980f8dd.avif?t=1740316050\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunted mansion. A date gone bad. A kidnapped friend! Can YOU help Andy save the day?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/394b0f6559909add9939e19639a4d6bb.avif?t=1740316050\" width=64 height=64 /></span> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/d0ab706e6fb0bcc8ffceff0b4de61341.avif?t=1740316050\" width=260 height=132 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/9718bdedfbc81b7da53079710a4e7634.poster.avif?t=1740316050\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815740/extras/9718bded